  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Premium-built genuine, synthetic leather upper\n\tVersatile low profile with padding at the tongue and collar\n\tPerforated forefoot increases airflow\n\tSecured with a lace closure\n\tSignature Swoosh and wordmark branding\n\tCushioned soft foam midsole with Air-Sole unit provides elevated traction\n\tGrippy rubber cupsole construction enhanced traction with a natural feel\n\tThe Nike Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes are imported.\n\n\nA classic design with modern touches, the Big Kids&#39; Nike Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes completes any low-key look with fresh, classic vibes. Dressed in a smooth, supple leather upper for premium durability and structure, their perforated construction increases ventilation for a breathable wearing experience. Enhanced with a comfort-elevated system that combines a plush footbed with the brand&#39;s iconic Air-Sole unit, they cradle feet with a light, cushioned feel.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Big Kids' Nike Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grade School</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Turf Orange/Bright Violet</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3489832</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style=